Don and Bill,

As you both know, we have discussed making  a change and having the both of
you exchange positions next year.

With both of your approvals, I would like to formally announce to the State
Officers and Appointed Officers at our next E.O. meeting, that for the
remainder of the year, Dad Enloe will be assisting the State Dad in order
to learn the position.   As well, Dad Lowery will work with Dad Enloe to
transition into the Membership Advisor position.

I would leave it to both of you to work out how you would like to divide
the responsibitilities.

The positions would become official at the next Conclave Installation.

Please let me know if you have any questions or concerns.   Please know how
much I appreciate you both.

Fraternally yours,
Steve

*Steve Johnston*

*Executive Officer*

